  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A cart starts from rest at point S and moves in a straight line with a constant acceleration. Two points X and Y are 0.50 m and 1.0 m from S.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>The cart passes X with speed v<sub>X</sub> and passes Y with speed v<sub>Y</sub>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v_{Y}}{v_{x}}\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
